        "Question Alert: At least 3 out of the 5 nominated members must be Whole-Time Members (WTMs).",
        "Section 4 of the SEBI Act, 1992 specifies the legal composition and structure of the SEBI Board.",
        "The RBI fields 1 representative on the SEBI Board, whereas the Ministry of Finance fields 2 members."
